WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.800
Hi, I'm Aaron from Orlando.
嗨，我是来自奥兰多的亚伦。

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.195
Hi, I'm Stacey from Albuquerque, New Mexico.
嗨，我是来自新墨西哥州阿尔伯克须的斯黛西。

00:00:05.195 --> 00:00:05.903
Hi, I'm Mimi.
嗨，我是咪咪。

00:00:05.903 --> 00:00:08.734
I'm in Los Angeles, but for college I was in the UK.
我在洛杉矶，但上大学时我在英国。

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:12.328
What how I met your mother means to me is that grief is temporary.
《老爸老妈的浪漫史》对我而言意味着悲伤只是暂时的。

00:00:12.328 --> 00:00:17.010
It means for me that happiness and humor are both found in the midst of great tragedy.
它对我意味着，幸福和幽默都可以在巨大的悲剧之中找到。

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.767
I saw as things happening in my life happened on screen in real time.
我看到我生活中的事情在屏幕上实时发生。

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:24.578
Sometimes even on the same day, which was a little dear, but good job.
有时甚至在同一天，这有点不可思议，但干得漂亮。

00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:31.330
The writers in the cast allowed those characters to feel all of those heart breaks without the need for an additional laugh.
编剧和演员让这些角色去体验所有的心碎，而不需要强加一个额外的笑点。

00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:36.890
Unfortunately, the episodes didn't air on UK TV at the same time that they aired on US TV.
不幸的是，这些剧集在英国电视上播出时，并不像它们在美国电视上播出时那样同步。

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:48.649
So, yes, I was pirating these episodes, like, rip streaming video length that frequently was reversed, so sometimes in my mind, the entrance to the apartment is on the other side of the screen.
所以，是的，我当时在盗版这些剧集，比如那种经常被颠倒的视频流长度，所以有时在我的脑海里，公寓的入口是在屏幕的另一边。

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:55.649
I was reminded that things don't always go as planned, but they happen the way they're supposed to, and there's always going to be people around to make sure you're okay.
我被提醒，事情并不总是按计划进行，但它们会按照本该发生的方式发生，而且总会有人在你身边确保你安然无恙。

00:00:55.649 --> 00:01:05.393
I'm alone won't be soon in New York City when I see you.
我一个人，当我在纽约看到你时，不会太久。

00:01:05.393 --> 00:01:15.310
Please permit me to tell you everything in New York City.
请允许我在纽约告诉你一切。

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:20.757
Hello and welcome to another episode of How We Made Your Mother.
你好，欢迎收看另一期的《我们是如何创造你母亲的》。

00:01:20.757 --> 00:01:22.204
I am Josh Radner.
我是乔什·拉德纳。

00:01:22.204 --> 00:01:24.588
I am here with Craig Thomas.
我和克雷格·托马斯在一起。

00:01:24.588 --> 00:01:25.950
Hello everybody.
大家好。

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.031
Hello, Craig.
你好，克雷格。

00:01:27.031 --> 00:01:32.020
