而且我认为，也要归功于马特，我们推销的第二件事是一个我们根本无权撰写的节目，我们最终把它卖给了福克斯。

00:05:08.964 --> 00:05:17.434
And I think Matt always knew he was like, you know, you can sell this one, but how about your mother's going to be the one that ends up going and low and old?
我想马特一直都知道，他会想：你知道，你可以卖掉这个，但是《老爸老妈的浪漫史》才是最终能拍成并大获成功的那个。

00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:17.970
Thank God.
谢天谢地。

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:18.470
Wow.
哇。

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:29.084
And boy, do you realize that when you sit down to write them, you sit down to write one and you have a bajillion ideas and the other one, you're like, I don't know how to get to page 10 on this one.
天哪，当你坐下来写的时候你就会意识到，当你坐下来写一个时，你有无数的点子，而对于另一个，你会想，我不知道这怎么能写到第10页。

00:05:29.084 --> 00:05:31.496
There's not going to be nine seasons of this.
这个绝对不会有九季。

00:05:31.496 --> 00:05:43.932
So did you have to, I mean, I know you're getting paid by 20th century Fox in kind of like a holding deal you can't write for anyone else But did he just say go write this pilot go write how I met your mother We pitched it verbally.
所以你们必须……我的意思是，我知道你们拿着二十世纪福克斯公司的钱，签订了一种不能为其他人写作的保留协议，但他只是说去写这个试播集，去写《老爸老妈的浪漫史》吗？我们是口头推销的。

00:05:43.932 --> 00:06:04.945
We didn't write it We pitched we pitched both verbally and you go around town you go to ABC at the you know at the time There was no streamers again old see a four mentioned incredibly old people and you go you drive around in person no zoom meetings You drive to NBC you drive to Fox you drive to CBS and you pitched them these ideas and we did And we did the rounds for both of those ideas.
我们没有写出来。我们推销的……我们都是口头推销的，然后在城里到处跑，去当时的美国广播公司（ABC），那时还没有流媒体，再次强调，刚才提到的那些极其老派的人，你亲自开车去，没有Zoom会议，你开车去全国广播公司（NBC），开车去福克斯（Fox），开车去哥伦比亚广播公司（CBS），向他们推销这些想法，我们确实这么做了。

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.759
So we pitched all the same people, both of those ideas.
我们带着这两个想法跑遍了所有人。

00:06:07.759 --> 00:06:11.759
One of them we sold the Fox, which was like the parent company of our deal.
其中一个我们卖给了福克斯，它是我们交易的母公司。

00:06:11.759 --> 00:06:15.399
They were in the vertical integration of the deal.
他们参与了交易的垂直整合。

00:06:15.399 --> 00:06:16.399
They didn't get high much.
他们没有那么兴奋。

00:06:16.399 --> 00:06:17.600
They didn't want how I met your mother.
他们不想要《老爸老妈的浪漫史》。

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.600
We pitched it.
我们推销了它。

