How much mother got a bunch of passes?
《老爸老妈浪漫史》拿到了多少通过许可？

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.800
We didn't, you know, landed at CBS.
我们没有，你知道的，最后落户在CBS。

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:25.199
We thought it was a landed NBC, but that didn't work out and CBS really wanted it.
我们本来以为会落户NBC，但没成功，而CBS真的很想要它。

00:06:25.199 --> 00:06:28.040
They really, it was just the moment that they were looking for a younger show.
他们确实很想要，当时他们正好在寻找一部更年轻化的剧集。

