I don't know if people, I mean, I guess maybe CBS is still like this, but like at the time especially, it was like such a, it was family sitcoms.
我不知道大家，我的意思是，我想也许CBS现在还是这样，但特别是当年，它就像是一个，全是家庭情景喜剧。

