Also, starting next week, we will begin our official rewatch of each episode of how I made your mother starting with the pilot.
另外，从下周开始，我们将正式重温《老爸老妈浪漫史》的每一集，从试播集开始。

00:50:12.889 --> 00:50:17.210
We strongly suggest that you watch the episode before listening to our discussion.
我们强烈建议你在听我们的讨论之前先看一遍那一集。

00:50:17.210 --> 00:50:24.970
We know that most of you will have seen it once or twice or according to the amazing messages you have sent us 17 or 30 times.
我们知道你们大部分人都已经看了一两遍，或者根据你们发给我们的惊人留言，看过17遍或30遍。

00:50:24.970 --> 00:50:26.756
But it's time to start again.
但现在是时候重新开始了。

00:50:26.756 --> 00:50:27.926
So rewatch with us.
所以和我们一起重温吧。

00:50:27.926 --> 00:50:30.759
And if it's your first time watching, welcome.
如果这是你第一次观看，欢迎加入。

00:50:30.759 --> 00:50:32.422
We're so happy you're here.
很高兴你能来。

