Just go to the website how we made your mother.com and click on contact.
只需访问网站 how I made your mother.com 并点击联系我们。

00:50:48.090 --> 00:50:54.316
And here are just a few of those incredible questions and stories we were seeing from around the world.
以下就是我们从世界各地收到的那些不可思议的提问和故事中的一小部分。

00:50:54.316 --> 00:50:56.250
This one is from Kajal in India.
这条来自印度的卡加尔（Kajal）。

00:50:56.250 --> 00:50:59.877
Hello legendary people, assuming I'm the first one to write.
你好，传奇人物们，假设我是第一个写信的人。

00:50:59.877 --> 00:51:01.389
Why would he assume that?
他为什么会这么假设？

00:51:01.389 --> 00:51:02.174
I don't know.
我不知道。

00:51:02.174 --> 00:51:03.081
He was correct.
